From df128da3beade6db90c1fd72704f67d1fae7d936 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MikiMiku <jonathanirvinjo@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 02:33:51 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] antinomie: retain bounded root-process ELF cores at exit

---
